      "subject": "change:20261029-itw-c4-statement-gates#why",
      "content": {
        "summary": "change:20261029-itw-c4-statement-gates why = \"Nothing refused a statement filed with nothing under it, a pilot card edited by hand inside its markers, a card left stale after its statements changed, or a card showing a value its sources dispute. The statement contract lives in private Project-Sophos, so this public repo's CI could not load it and the C2 and C3 statement tests skipped there in silence.\"",
