        "summary": "change:20261029-itw-c4-statement-gates enables = \"Pre-commit and CI refuse itw_statement_unsourced, itw_infobox_drift and itw_conflict_published, each with a remedy and a repair-by-hand link. Where the contract is present every card is re-rendered and every value resolved again; in CI a hash manifest the renderer writes proves each card is what was rendered from the files as they are, and the output names what that depth cannot see.\"",
